{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08T1", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:790dca1f5f3e3390be9e1c26dd6cb5160aec129a61ba3c943e992a4328f9a535", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nAs promised above we define the cotangent complex of a morphism of\nschemes as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3bfc1447c9be89a08e443c71663607da4650d99827c93fc58ffbe060bba669d2", "unit_id": "tag:08T1:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "08T1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$L_{X/Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$Y$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-cotangent-complex-morphism-ringed-spaces}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-cotangent-morphism-schemes}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2cef80fa072b871dc8fdc137c31186d1e0b9ea5a035aeadf76e13e4453778070", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5145be9fb7d2d1b9bceb3dc449a0d5a095c46d9647bc756963f46c38f040fe17", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes. The <TEXTITOPEN_0001>cotangent complex\n<MATH_0002> of <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is the cotangent complex of <MATH_0005> as a\nmorphism of ringed spaces\n(Definition <REF_0001>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:afeb902843bbcdc42e86013c3ea39e6f3787055e8657a34df0ff2134af8ca74f", "unit_id": "tag:08T2:statement"}
{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08T1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$L_{X/Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$D_\\QCoh(\\mathcal{O}_X)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-cotangent-morphism-ringed-spaces}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:aca3dec2b20db7b51e5042222c9cfc7382e5fe8a5d42f1fa03a571ce0c641b87", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9b34d41171a6248652cc683e7456ee6e8fa541381a5714ca6bc4e3773fc3881c", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn particular, the results of\nSection <REF_0001> apply\nto cotangent complexes of morphisms of schemes.\nThe next lemma shows this definition is compatible with the definition\nfor ring maps and it also implies that <MATH_0001> is an\nobject of <MATH_0002>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:967283422527e4d85eea2272494d5bb4ce8967595cad81057f56aee44ccc233d", "unit_id": "tag:08T1:prose-0002"}
